 "insight": [
  "The value of Luxembourg's fuel imports increased from 2.05 billion euros in 2021 to 4.00 billion euros in 2022.",
  "This represents a 95.3% rise in imports over the year.",
  "The peak import value was 4.00 billion euros in 2022.",
  "The data are given in current euros and do not account for price changes over time.",
  "Therefore, the increase may partly reflect changes in fuel prices rather than just volume changes."
